Task: Migrate lib/cache/query-optimizer.ts (reopened) — bind params safely

Summary:
Rewrote executeOptimizedRaw so $n placeholders are converted into a
parameterized chain of Drizzle sql fragments (via sql.join) instead of
being string-interpolated into sql.raw. Drizzle / postgres-js now binds
each value through the driver, restoring safe parameter handling for
Date/json/boolean values and removing the SQL-injection surface for
any future caller. Missing bind values now throw immediately instead
of silently producing malformed SQL. executeBatchRawQueries is
unchanged at the API surface and inherits the safer binding.

Files:
- apps/reading-advantage/lib/cache/query-optimizer.ts
- apps/reading-advantage/__test__/query-optimizer.test.ts (new)

